#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:56
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Sign in from the Connect window, which opens over the chat at /connect — from Create an account, or from anything you try that needs one. It carries the whole flow: pick a nickname, register a new one or enter a password for a registered one, and choose whether to remember the terminal. A remembered terminal signs you in with a single click, and one set to auto-login takes you straight to the chat."
msgstr "Sign in from the Connect window, which opens over the chat at /connect — from Create an account, or from anything you try that needs one. It carries the whole flow: pick a nickname, register a new one or enter a password for a registered one, and choose whether to remember the terminal. A remembered terminal signs you in with a single click, and one set to auto-login takes you straight to the chat."

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:64
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The Site's Pages on the Desktop"
msgstr "デスクトップ上のサイトのページ"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat/chat/help_topics/user_interface.ex:78
